<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>纯文字浮窗</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>纯文字浮窗</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>默认关闭。仅隐藏浮窗背景与装饰，保留实时监测文字。开启时不避让灵动岛，顶部文字可能被硬件遮挡；状态栏吸附、自动折叠及键盘避让临时不生效，普通配置不变。关闭后恢复普通外观与位置。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yourname.sbcpufloating</string>
			<key>get</key>
			<string>getPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key>
			<string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用纯文字浮窗</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>floatingTextOnlyMode</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>独立显示项目</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>以下开关只影响纯文字浮窗，初始默认全部开启，不继承或改写普通浮窗开关。◉ 为 CPU 占用，▰ 为电量；MHz / fps / °C / mA 为频率、帧率、温度、电流；S1 / S2 为各卡 dBm 信号强度，不显示运营商、频段或制式。-- 表示未取得数值。不显示温控运行和充电状态；全关则不显示文字。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.yourname.sbcpufloating</string>
			<key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>CPU 占用（◉）</string>
			<key>key</key><string>floatingTextOnlyShowCPU</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.yourname.sbcpufloating</string>
			<key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>CPU 频率（MHz）</string>
			<key>key</key><string>floatingTextOnlyShowFrequency</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.yourname.sbcpufloating</string>
			<key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>帧率（fps）</string>
			<key>key</key><string>floatingTextOnlyShowFPS</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.yourname.sbcpufloating</string>
			<key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>电量（▰）</string>
			<key>key</key><string>floatingTextOnlyShowBattery</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.yourname.sbcpufloating</string>
			<key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>电池温度（°C）</string>
			<key>key</key><string>floatingTextOnlyShowTemperature</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.yourname.sbcpufloating</string>
			<key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>电流（mA）</string>
			<key>key</key><string>floatingTextOnlyShowCurrent</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.yourname.sbcpufloating</string>
			<key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>SIM 1 信号（S1）</string>
			<key>key</key><string>floatingTextOnlyShowSIM1</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.yourname.sbcpufloating</string>
			<key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>SIM 2 信号（S2）</string>
			<key>key</key><string>floatingTextOnlyShowSIM2</string>
			<key>default</key><true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>字号</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>独立基准字号 8–24 pt，不改变普通浮窗字号或缩放。所有选中项目始终单行显示；超过屏幕可用宽度会整体缩字，必要时低于 8 pt，不换行、不省略。若字太小可减少显示项目。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yourname.sbcpufloating</string>
			<key>get</key>
			<string>getPreferenceValue:</string>
			<key>set</key>
			<string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>文字大小</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>floatingTextOnlyFontSize</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>13</integer>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>8</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>24</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>顶部预设</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>选择预设会清零 X/Y 偏移。顶部居中不是屏幕中央；本模式不避让灵动岛。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>左上角</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>topLeft</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>顶部居中</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>topCenter</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>右上角</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>topRight</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>位置微调</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>每次移动 8 pt，可拖动浮窗；X 正数向右，Y 正数向下。数值相对所选预设，最终位置限制在屏幕边缘。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>↑ 向上 8 pt</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>moveUp</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>↓ 向下 8 pt</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>moveDown</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>← 向左 8 pt</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>moveLeft</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>→ 向右 8 pt</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>moveRight</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>编辑水平偏移 X</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>editX</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>编辑垂直偏移 Y</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>editY</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>文字颜色</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>自动模式跟随系统外观：浅色模式黑字，深色模式白字，不检测背景像素。自定义颜色通过系统选色面板选择，完成或下滑关闭后保存并启用；不透明文字，默认蓝色。颜色设置仅影响纯文字浮窗。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>自动模式</string>
            <key>textColorMode</key><integer>0</integer>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>automaticText</string>
		</dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSButtonCell</string>
            <key>label</key><string>自定义文字颜色</string>
            <key>textColorMode</key><integer>3</integer>
            <key>action</key><string>customText</string>
        </dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>固定白字（深色背景）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>whiteText</string>
            <key>textColorMode</key><integer>1</integer>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>固定黑字（浅色背景）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>blackText</string>
            <key>textColorMode</key><integer>2</integer>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
